&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Director, Product Management to lead our Fleet and Autonomous Vehicle verticals. Reporting to the SVP of Product, you will own the product strategy, roadmap, and P&amp;amp;L for solutions serving fleet operators, commercial vehicle customers, and Autonomous Vehicle partners — operating as a general manager who aligns engineering, design, and go-to-market teams to deliver outcomes at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role spans hardware, software, and services — you will shape the product portfolio across charging hardware, fleet-management software, energy management, and autonomous vehicle readiness solutions while driving partnerships that expand our addressable market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Bring to ChargePoint&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product strategy, roadmap, and P&amp;amp;L for the Fleet &amp;amp; Autonomous Vehicle segment (depot fleet, take-home fleet, autonomous vehicle, truck/bus OEMs) — setting vision and making partnerships, pricing, packaging, and launch decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of product managers, designers, and NPI leads; ship outcomes with minimal handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the hardware portfolio (pantograph chargers, truck charging, robotic charging) and the software platform (ViriCiti) as a unified product experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own strategic partnerships — including relationships with autonomous vehicle companies and truck/bus OEMs — and decide when to build, buy, or partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of the go-to-market strategy with Sales, Marketing, and Operations as the single point of accountability for the&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools and emerging technologies to compress team sizes, dissolve traditional role boundaries, and accelerate product delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of product management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping integrated hardware and software products with unified priorities across both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record in fleet electrification, electric vehicle charging infrastructure, autonomous vehicles, or adjacent the autonomous vehicle-industry / mobility sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated P&amp;amp;L ownership of a real business line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience restructuring product teams around AI and automation, not just adopting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
