&lt;li&gt;An advanced understanding of corporate financial planning, modeling, reporting and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think creatively, highly-driven and self-motivated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of analytical capability with the proven ability to identify business challenges, structure recommendations and provide insights to enable high-level strategic vision&lt;/li&gt;
