&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact transformation role at the intersection of finance, technology, and supply chain — sitting within the CIO organisation and working in close partnership with ChargePoint&#39;s CFO, CAO, and Chief Manufacturing &amp;amp; Supply Chain Officer. You will own the strategy and execution for modernising ChargePoint&#39;s financial and supply chain systems, embedding AI-driven automation, and driving a step-change in how the business makes data-informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a maintenance role. You will be expected to challenge legacy processes, bring a forward-looking AI and automation perspective to our NetSuite ecosystem and broader finance stack, and translate technology possibilities into measurable business outcomes. The right person thinks like a product leader, operates with the credibility of a finance insider, and has the drive to build something lasting. For the right candidate, this role carries clear potential to grow in scope and responsibility as ChargePoint scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will manage a small, high-calibre team — including NetSuite functional and technical administrators and Business Analysts — with the mandate to grow and evolve the team as the transformation programme matures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finance Systems Modernisation &amp;amp; AI Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Finance Technology Roadmap: &lt;/strong&gt;Define and drive the multi-year strategy for ChargePoint&#39;s financial systems landscape — NetSuite at the core — aligning technology investment with CFO and CAO priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed AI &amp;amp; Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify and implement AI/ML-driven automation across financial close, reconciliation, AP/AR, and reporting — reducing manual effort, improving accuracy, and accelerating the close cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligent Close &amp;amp; Reconciliation: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the transformation of ChargePoint&#39;s financial close process — designing workflows that leverage automation, exception-based review, and real-time data to drive speed and confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AP/AR Process Innovation: &lt;/strong&gt;Modernise accounts payable and receivable processes through automation and integration — improving cash flow visibility, reducing processing time, and strengthening controls.&lt;/li&gt;
