&lt;li&gt;Have the skills to create simple solutions for complex problems quickly; often benefiting from tried-and-true techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put user value before tech, learn quickly, work iteratively and naturally seek collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
