&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in building REST APIs and utilizing OpenAPI/Swagger Spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge in Kafka or Flink&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with Agile Development, CI/CD tools, project tracking tools, and familiarity with GRPC, GraphQL, and automation tools like Ansible, Chef, Puppet.&lt;/li&gt;
