&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;With electric vehicles expected to be nearly 30% of new vehicle sales by 2025 and more than 50% by 2040, electric mobility is becoming a reality. ChargePoint (NYSE: CHPT) is at the center of this revolution, powering one of the world’s leading EV charging networks and a comprehensive set of hardware, software and mobile solutions for every charging need across North America and Europe. We bring together drivers, businesses, automakers, policymakers, utilities and other stakeholders to make e-mobility a global reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Since our founding in 2007, ChargePoint has focused solely on making the transition to electric easy for businesses, fleets and drivers. ChargePoint offers a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to create an all-electric future and a trillion-dollar market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At ChargePoint, we foster a positive and productive work environment by committing to live our values of Be Courageous, Charge Together, Love our Customers, Operate with Openness, and Relentlessly Pursue Awesome. These values guide how we show up every day, align, and work together to build a brighter future for all of us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Join the team that is building the EV charging industry and make your mark on how people and goods will get everywhere they need to go, in any context, for generations to come.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Reports To&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chief Marketing and Growth Officer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;ChargePoint is seeking a Technical Marketing Manager to bridge engineering and the market by translating complex EV charging products into clear, compelling technical narratives. This role will support networked charging hardware, energy management software, and fleet solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;You will create high‑impact technical content, enable sales and partners with accurate positioning, and ensure technical materials stay current as products evolve. This role requires close collaboration with product management and solutions engineering, as well as external engagement through events and customer briefings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Bring to ChargePoint&lt;/h3&gt;
You bring the ability to turn technical product details into buyer‑focused storytelling that drives understanding and adoption. Your work will improve sales effectiveness, strengthen product differentiation, and ensure customers and partners have clear, accurate technical guidance. You operate independently, stay close to evolving product capabilities, and use modern tools, including AI, to scale content creation and maintain quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The ideal candidate will have prior Technical Marketing, Product Marketing, Solutions Engineering, or Sales Engineering experience supporting complex technical products. Candidates should be able to demonstrate ownership of technical content, customer-facing product messaging, technical enablement, demos, and cross-functional collaboration with product and engineering teams. Candidates with a background in Sales Engineering, Solutions Engineering, or Solutions Architecture who are looking to transition into Technical Marketing are strongly encouraged to apply.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;8+ years of experience in Technical Marketing, Product Marketing, Solutions Marketing, Technical Product Marketing, Sales Engineering, or Solutions Engineering roles supporting complex technical products, including experience owning positioning, technical content, sales enablement, and go-to-market initiatives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Technical background in EV charging, energy management, fleet electrification, charging infrastructure, or related energy technologies, including knowledge of protocols such as OCPP and connected energy ecosystems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven ability to independently create technical marketing content (e.g., white papers, solution briefs, competitive analyses, architecture diagrams, integration guides, demos)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong written communication skills with the ability to clearly translate complex technical concepts into customer-facing messaging and technical narratives&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable working hands-on with products and collaborating closely with engineering, product management, and solutions engineering teams&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience using AI tools to support content creation, research, and analysis&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Experience developing competitive technical comparisons based on product capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Familiarity with creating architecture diagrams and integration guides&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience supporting product launches with technical positioning, sales enablement, and technical training materials&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Track record of maintaining and scaling technical content libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf&quot;&gt;Public speaking experience at industry events, webinars, or customer briefings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote&lt;/p&gt;
